Antibacterial non-woven fabrics are added with antibacterial ingredients on the basis of the original ordinary non-woven fabrics. The most common method is to add antibacterial agents during the hot melt processing of non-woven fabrics, such as Langyi’s AntibacMax silver ion antibacterial agent.
Langyi New Materials has developed a spinning-grade silver ion antibacterial agent, which has the characteristics of small particle size, uniform particle size distribution, and good dispersion. The processing technology of the woven fabric will not affect the original physical properties of the non-woven fabric.
