When it comes to light transmittance, we have to mention Po film. Po film is a new agricultural film made by using high-grade olefins as raw materials, adding other additives and external spraying and drying process.
It has high transparency, superior daylighting, reduces the light loss in the shed, and the temperature in the shed rises quickly in the morning. For solar radiation, Po film is almost “transparent”.
